OL,3,AWatch the moment bridge hit at least 45
OL,4,Atimes is driven into again
OL,5,
OL,6,FA railway bridge considered the "most
OL,7,Fbashed" in Wales, having been struck
OL,8,Falmost 50 times, has been hit again.
OL,10,FIn 2020 Network Rail said Trafle Mill
OL,11,Fbridge in Gowerton, Swansea, had been
OL,12,Fhit 33 times in the preceding decade,
OL,13,Fthe most of any bridge in Wales and the
OL,14,Fborder areas. There have been 12
OL,15,Freported strikes since 2023.
OL,17,FDespite sensors being installed to
OL,18,Falert drivers of the height
OL,19,Frestrictions, CCTV footage shows a
OL,20,Futilities lorry with wooden poles and a
OL,21,Fcrane arm colliding with the bridge on
OL,22,F25 October.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
